  "mechanicalNotes": [
    "Silent and Targeting Bombs spend the normal bomb pool and resolve scaling ranged-touch damage; Targeting Bomb also tracks its area-wide faerie fire duration. Stonekin adds both extracts and provides prepared-extract-gated stalagmite and meld transformations with exact durations. Swift Alchemy returns at level 18 while Instant Alchemy remains removed. Svirfneblin eligibility remains advisory until that ancestry enters the builder."
